{# Variables: extractions (list[{paper_id, paper_title, datasets, techniques, metrics}]) #}
Synthesize a cross-paper methodology comparison matrix from per-paper extractions.

PER-PAPER METHODOLOGY EXTRACTIONS (already-extracted typed JSON — do NOT add raw text):
{% for e in extractions %}
- paper_id: {{ e.paper_id }}
  paper_title: "{{ e.paper_title | replace('"', "'") }}"
  datasets: {{ e.datasets | tojson }}
  techniques: {{ e.techniques | tojson }}
  metrics: {{ e.metrics | tojson }}
{% endfor %}

OUTPUT: STRICT JSON matching MethodologyMatrix:
  - rows: [
      {paper_id, paper_title, datasets, techniques, metrics},
      ...
    ]
One row per paper above; preserve paper_id + paper_title verbatim.
